7. USER ROLES

Exactly three roles:

client
driver
admin

A user has exactly one role.

There is NO:

client + driver

dual role.

There is no separate accountant role.

Financial permissions may later be attached to administrators.

---

8. AUTHENTICATION

Use Supabase Auth.

Support:

- email/password
- authenticated sessions
- logout
- password reset
- protected routes

Every authenticated user must have a corresponding:

profiles

row.

Role must NOT be freely editable by the user.

Role changes must be controlled by trusted server-side logic/admin operations.

