9. USER PROFILE

Common profile fields:

id
role
full_name
phone
photo_url
identity_status
created_at
updated_at

Identity status:

pending
verified
rejected

Identity card is required.

Identity document is stored in a private Supabase Storage bucket.

Users can:

pending → logged in
pending → use non-sensitive functionality

But a driver who is not verified cannot create/publish trips.

Rejected identity documents can be uploaded again:

rejected
   ↓
new document
   ↓
pending

