10. DRIVER VERIFICATION

Drivers require additional verification.

Required documents can include:

identity_card
driving_license
vehicle_registration
insurance

Create:

verification_documents

with document status:

pending
verified
rejected

Admin can:

- review
- verify
- reject
- provide rejection reason

A driver must have an overall verified state before creating a trip.

