11. VEHICLE

MVP rule:

«One driver = one vehicle.»

Vehicle fields:

id
driver_id
brand
model
color
plate_number
capacity
created_at
updated_at

Capacity is manually entered by the driver.

Enforce:

vehicles.driver_id UNIQUE

Vehicle capacity is used as the maximum passenger capacity.

