33. RATINGS

After completed bookings:

Client can rate Driver:

1–5

Driver can rate Client:

1–5

Optional comment.

Create:

ratings

Fields:

id
booking_id
from_user_id
to_user_id
rating
comment
created_at

Constraints:

rating BETWEEN 1 AND 5
UNIQUE(booking_id, from_user_id)

Only participants of the booking can rate each other.

