52. ERROR HANDLING

All important operations need clear errors.

Examples:

No seats available
Payment failed
Trip no longer available
Driver not verified
Booking expired
Transfer unavailable
Resale unavailable
Invalid route
Invalid checkpoint order

Do not expose raw database errors to end users.

Create typed application errors.

