checkpoint ordering
segment generation

Booking

seat availability
multi-segment reservation
overbooking prevention

Payment

payment success
payment failure
payment timeout
refund

Resale

partial resale
seat locking
listing closure

Transfer

compatible trip
approval
rejection
price preservation

Cancellation

80% eligible refund
no-show = 0 refund

---

62. IMPORTANT DATABASE INVARIANTS

The following must be enforced server-side:

one role per user

one vehicle per driver

unverified driver cannot create/publish trip

trip requires at least two checkpoints

checkpoint sequence must be valid

segment capacity cannot exceed vehicle capacity

reserved seats cannot exceed capacity

booking seats cannot exceed available seats

booking pickup must precede dropoff

booking price is immutable after confirmation

resale price cannot exceed original seat price

resale cannot sell more seats than available

transfer cannot create duplicate seats

payment state cannot be forged by client

refund cannot exceed paid amount

rating must be 1–5

user cannot rate unrelated booking

role cannot be self-modified

---

